{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Let terror fall upon them.</b> It reverts to Edom and Moab, even though Canaan was mentioned above. Similarly, בעמוד ענן ידבר אליהם (Psalms 99:7), as I explained וישם דמי מלחמה בשלום (1 Kings 2:5) — it reverts to Abner alone; ואת אשתו ואמהותיו וילדו (Genesis 20:17) — it reverts to his wife and the maidservants. And all this is because of עד יעבור עמך ה׳ — that they passed by them before they came to the land of Canaan." "And he said יעבור twice, because they circled Mount Seir for many days. And the meaning of קנית: they were slaves to Egypt, and you acquired them to be your slaves."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:47.462798198Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}